d men. When Liu Bei annexed the four commanderies of southern Jing, he launched an attack against Liu Du. Xing Daorong engaged in duels against Zhang Fei and Zhao Yun, but was defeated and captured. He then feigned surrender to Liu Bei, when the ruse unraveled, he was run through and killed by Zhao Yun.","jp":"零陵太守・劉度配下の武将。開山の大斧を振るい、「万夫不当の勇」と称された。劉備が荊南四郡を併合すべく劉度を攻撃した際、張飛や趙雲と一騎討ちを行うも敗れて捕らえられる。その後、劉備に偽りの降伏を試みるも策は失敗し、趙雲に討ち取られた。","kr":"영릉태수 유도의 수하 무장. 개산대부를 능숙하게 다루며 만부부당의 용맹을 떨친다고 평가받았다. 유비가 형남 4군을 병합하며 유도를 공격했을 때, 형도영은 장비, 조운과 일기토를 벌였으나 패배하여 사로잡혔다. 이후 유비에게 거짓 투항을 시도했으나 계책이 간파당해 조운에게 찔려 죽었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"62","id":"WJ10187","remark":"","surname":"邢","surnameTc":"邢","surnameEn":"Xing","surnameJp":"邢","surnameKr":"형","surnameOther":"","name":"道荣","nameTc":"道榮","nameEn":"Daorong","nameJp":"道栄","nameKr":"도영","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"邢道荣","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"193","city":"CS1040","gender":"0","rule":"69","force":"80","wise":"41","politics":"16","charm":"13","will":"47","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"10","wiseTalent":"3","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"1","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"38/83/38/38/38/15/50/38","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1001105;1004400","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1007005","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4700","battleSoulPoint":"6400","debateSoulPoint":"1600","strategy":"1005215","strategy2":"1008401","professions":"3/0/1/0/0/1/2/0/0/0/1/2/2/0/1/0/1/2/1/0/0/2/0/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"3","compatible":"8","loyalty":"0","reputation":"350","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"172","show":"184","death":"209","age":"0","injury":"","dea